# StudyFlow AI Assistant Environment Variables
# Configure one or more of the following keys in your Vercel/Netlify dashboard:

# OpenAI (Recommended: GPT-4o-mini / GPT-4o)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Google Gemini (Gemini 1.5 Flash / Pro)
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...

# Groq (Llama 3.3 70B Ultra-Fast)
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# AI Model & Provider Overrides (Optional)
# AI_PROVIDER=openai
# AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
